{
  "description": "Microsoft 365 questions from eval/m365_questions_draft.md, cross-source with Flow and Datto (H, three-way H7-H8), safety (I) and Flow/Datto boundaries (J). Scored on tool calls (x_tb_brain) and the reply; sources / forbid_sources score routing on its own line. Expected answers assume M365_MODE=stub, DATTO_MODE=stub and FLOW_MODE=stub; run as Tre (ts) via --as-email. The draft's BPIE, VANG, ZEBB and ZTB are mapped onto the stub: A4/B4/D3/G2 BPIE -> WDON, A6 VANG -> NGMC, A7/B9/G7 ZEBB -> WDON, B8 Sara at VANG -> Debe at WDON, G3 VANG -> BUCK, I7 BPIE (no P1) -> BUCK, I6 ZTB (no tenant id) -> ACME, B6 buckdental.com -> buckheadpeds.example, H3 BUCK-1234 -> WDON-2621, H4 BPIE -> WDON-2619, A8 Michael Sodl -> Debe (Sodl is I13).",
